sequenceDiagram
    %% ============================================================
    %% sofagent v1.2.3 调用流 — 三条主链
    %% ============================================================

    %% ── 链 ①：LOOP 运行 + graph-state v2 落盘（交付二 TS 侧） ──
    autonumber
    participant CLI as sofagent-orchestrator
    participant G as loop/graph.ts
    participant D as LoopGraphDeps
    participant PN as loop/plan-node.ts
    participant ND as loop/nodes.ts
    participant FS as $SOFAGENT_HOME/data/dashboard/

    CLI->>G: runLoopGraph(task)
    G->>D: buildDeps() 注入 dashboardDir=resolveDashboardDir()
    Note over D: AD-2: $SOFAGENT_HOME/data<br/>(不再用 cwd/.sofagent)
    G->>PN: plan 节点执行
    PN->>FS: writeGraphState(dashboardDir, v2快照)
    Note over FS: 保旧3字段 + version/nodes/<br/>edges/wave/degradationLevel
    loop 每个节点 (engineer/audit/reviewer/human_confirm)
        G->>ND: withCheckpoint 包装执行
        ND->>FS: writeGraphState(dashboardDir, 增量状态)
    end

    %% ── 链 ②：worktree 全生命周期（交付一原语 + 单测模拟并行） ──
    participant T as vitest 单测
    participant WI as worktree-isolation.ts
    participant MG as worktree-merge-gate.ts
    participant CR as conflict-resolver.ts
    participant AU as @sofagent/audit
    participant GIT as git CLI

    T->>WI: sweepStaleWorktrees(repoDir)
    WI->>GIT: worktree prune + 注册表比对
    GIT-->>WI: 回收残留(有create无cleanup)
    par 模拟两个并行 SubAgent
        T->>WI: handleA.create() → wt-{uuidA}
        WI->>GIT: worktree add .sofagent/worktrees/wt-A
    and
        T->>WI: handleB.create() → wt-{uuidB}
        WI->>GIT: worktree add .sofagent/worktrees/wt-B
    end
    T->>WI: handleA.diff()
    WI->>MG: evaluate(handleA)
    MG->>AU: 21 条规则审计(diff 硬证据)
    alt audit PASS
        MG->>GIT: merge --no-ff sofagent/wt-A
    else audit FAIL
        MG->>FS: 丢弃 + 证据落 data/audit/
    end
    T->>CR: detect([handleA, handleB])
    CR-->>T: scope优先→先到先得→HITL
    CR->>FS: worktree-conflicts.jsonl

    %% ── 链 ③：Dashboard 整帧渲染（交付二/三/五/六 bash 侧） ──
    participant U as 用户终端
    participant SH as sofagent-dashboard.sh
    participant FR as forge-runs/latest.json
    participant WS as workspace-changes.jsonl

    U->>SH: sofagent-dashboard --watch [--technical]
    loop 每 2s
        SH->>FS: jq graph-state.json (// empty 兜底旧格式)
        SH->>FR: jq latest.json → status.json + sub-progress
        SH->>WS: tail workspace-changes.jsonl
        Note over SH: humanize_status() 翻译状态词<br/>(--technical 时跳过)
        SH-->>U: 三栏 + 全宽控制图/FORGE/最近变更
    end
